e roll. No phone pictures. If I miss something, it stays missed, and I write it down in the notebook instead."}</p><h2>{"Six o'clock, the old port"}</h2><p>{"The fish market on the Quai des Belges starts before the light does. By six the tables are out, the boats are tied up and the first buyers are arguing gently about sea bream. I spend four frames here, which is already too many."}</p><figure><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1600x1067.svg"} alt={"A fishmonger laying out sea bream on a blue table on the old port at sunrise"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><figcaption>{"Frame 3. The first sun reaches the tables at 6.40."}</figcaption></figure><p>{"The trick at the market is to stand still. Walk around and every fishmonger poses; stay by one table for twenty minutes and they forget you."}</p><blockquote><p>{"Thirty-six frames is a strict editor. It makes you wait for the picture instead of collecting near misses."}</p></blockquote><h2>{"Noon, the Calanques"}</h2><p>{"By noon the light is flat and the city is loud, so I take the bus to the end of the line and walk to the coves. The water does the work here. Two frames of the same diver, one second apart, and I still can't choose."}</p><div className={"article-wide grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={"A woman dives from pale limestone rocks into clear turquoise water"} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} className={"aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover rounded-(--radius-md)"} /><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={"The same diver a second later, stretched out over the water"} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} className={"aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover rounded-(--radius-md)"} /></div><h2>{"Nine o'clock, the last ferry"}</h2><p>{"I keep three frames for the evening, and as always I need five. The last one goes on the ferry back across the harbour, the city turning pink behind the boats. It is not the best frame on the roll. It is the one I will print."}</p><p>{"The roll goes to the lab on Monday. I'll post the contact sheet here when it comes back, misses and all."}</p></div><div className={"container mt-[clamp(3rem,2rem+3vw,5rem)]"}><div className={"custom-author mx-auto"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={""} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><div><p className={"m-0 font-semibold"}>{"Odile Faure"}</p><p className={"mt-2 mb-0 text-soft"}>{"Editorial and travel photographer, based in Marseille. Fourteen years on assignment for magazines, hotels and travel brands."}</p><a href={"#page=demo-photographer-1-about"} className={"custom-more mt-3"}>{"About Odile "}<i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div></div></div></article><section className={"custom-section custom-panel"} aria-labelledby={"pg1-related"}><div className={"container"}><h2 id={"pg1-related"} className={"custom-title mt-0 mb-[clamp(2.5rem,1.5rem+3vw,4rem)]"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Keep reading"}</h2><div className={"grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-3"}><a href={"#page=demo-photographer-1-article"} className={"custom-post group"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><figure className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1600x1067.svg"} alt={"Strips of colour negatives and a loupe on a glowing light table"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><span className={"custom-post-meta"}><span>{"Process"}</span>{"5 min read"}</span><span className={"custom-post-title"}><span className={"hover-underline"}>{"Why I still shoot a roll of film on every commission"}</span></span></a><a href={"#page=demo-photographer-1-article"} className={"custom-post group"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><figure className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/2400x1600.svg"} alt={"Steam drifts from a noodle bar doorway onto a wet, dark alley"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><span className={"custom-post-meta"}><span>{"Series Notes"}</span>{"8 min read"}</span><span className={"custom-post-title"}><span className={"hover-underline"}>{"Twenty minutes after the rain: notes from Tokyo"}</span></span></a><a href={"#page=demo-photographer-1-article"} className={"custom-post group"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><figure className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1600x1067.svg"} alt={"Coffee, apricots and croissants on a balcony table above a quiet harbour"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><span className={"custom-post-meta"}><span>{"For Hotels"}</span>{"6 min read"}</span><span className={"custom-post-title"}><span className={"hover-underline"}>{"What hotels get wrong about breakfast photographs"}</span></span></a></div></div></section></main><Frame1 /><button data-back-top={""} aria-label={"Back to top"} className={"back-to-top fixed bottom-8 right-8 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer border-0 text-(--color-on-primary) bg-primary shadow-token-lg z-sticky"}><i className={"ph ph-arrow-up"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></button></>;}

